    {
      "title": "‘GB News wouldn’t touch him’: Milo Yiannopoulos will struggle to fit in with UK right wing",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/aug/30/milo-yiannopoulos-struggle-fit-uk-right-wing",
      "description": "<p>‘Alt-right’ agitator and former Trump backer deported from US is said also to be too extreme for Reform</p><p>As he arrives back in the UK after being deported from the US by the Trump administration, the far-right provocateur Milo Yiannopoulos may be wondering what lies ahead for him in his native country.</p><p>The “alt-right” agitator, 41, made his name in the US by promoting Donald Trump and associating with his allies before the 2016 election.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/aug/30/milo-yiannopoulos-struggle-fit-uk-right-wing\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-08-30T17:50:02"
    },
    {
      "title": "Trump ‘border czar’ denies Milo Yiannopoulos was deported quickly to spare him from ICE detention",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/aug/30/trump-border-czar-tom-homan-milo-yiannopoulos-arrest-deportation",
      "description": "<p>Tom Homan denies British far-right commentator, who was deported one day after arrest, got preferential treatment</p><p>The White House “border czar,” Tom Homan, denied on Sunday that <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/aug/29/milo-yiannopoulos-deported\">deporting</a> British far-right commentator Milo Yiannopoulos just a day after being arrested by US Immigration and Customs Enforcement (ICE) amounted to preferential treatment.</p><p>Homan said it was his understanding that Yiannopoulos, 41, had overstayed what he believed to be a visitor visa, had not appeared at an immigration hearing and was issued a final order of removal on 22 July.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/aug/30/trump-border-czar-tom-homan-milo-yiannopoulos-arrest-deportation\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-08-30T19:36:57"
    }
